        "explanation": "Doctor invokes prior knowledge of chemotherapy, lumbar puncture, and marrow evaluation history to connect fragmented outside records with the current discharge transition, maintaining continuity.",
        "quote": "既往多次化疗、腰穿鞘内化疗和骨髓穿刺是在外院完成"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00117",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly recognizes the infection risk from neutropenia and the bleeding risk from thrombocytopenia, linking them to specific emergency actions, demonstrating strong safety risk recognition.",
        "quote": "白细胞低时感染进展可能很快，血小板低时出血也可能加重"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
