        "quote": "回家护理确实需要特别注意"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00117",
        "explanation": "Doctor reinforces the caregiver's own correct judgment (37度多的 observation plan) and validates their approach, demonstrating patient/family adaptation.",
        "quote": "37度多但她说很难受——您的做法对"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
